  "description": "Node test #11 \u2014 Retry. Webhook \u2192 Transform 'attempt' \u2192 Branch on {{trigger.ok}} == yes. YES \u2192 success reply. NO \u2192 Retry (max 2) sends the flow back to 'attempt'; after 2 retries it takes the exhausted route \u2192 give-up reply.",
  "enabled": true,
  "folderId": null,
